            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KMC"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tasted good, like pumpkin ice cream. However, I made it one day in advance and the mixture crystallized; tasted like it had ice crystals in it. Kind of like ice cream that melts and refreezes. Maybe tastes better when you only freeze the recommended amount of time.",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-25T20:05:58.597Z"
          },
          {
